---
layout: layout.njk
title: Procedure
description: Step-by-step nursing procedures with rationale.
category: Procedure
---

<div class="category-header">
    <div class="cat-icon">🩺</div>
    <h1>Procedure</h1>
    <p class="cat-desc">Step-by-step nursing procedures with scientific rationale, indications, contraindications, equipment list, and nursing considerations. Perfect for ANM, GNM, and BSc Nursing practical files and OSCE preparation.</p>
</div>

<div class="post-list">
{% set posts = collections.procedure | reverse %}
{% for post in posts %}
    <div class="post-card">
        <div class="post-info">
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            <p class="post-meta">{{ post.date.toLocaleDateString('en-IN') }} | {{ post.data.reference }}</p>
        </div>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn">View Procedure</a>
    </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
